<title>NEW ZEALAND: TABLE-NZ ADRs mixed in NY, Dow surges beyond 8,000.</title>
<headline>TABLE-NZ ADRs mixed in NY, Dow surges beyond 8,000.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs were mixed in late New York trade as the Dow Jones Industrial Index shot up 69.21 points to 8,044.92 by 7.30 a.m. NZ time.</p>
<p>Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S. and Australia.</p>
<p>Company	Exchange    Last	  Net change</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.    US$28 1/2	 -0/01  *</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.    US$31 5/8	 +0/01  *</p>
<p>FCL Paper	N.Y.    US$22/07	  +0/03  *</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.    US$13 1/8	 -0 1/4 *</p>
<p>MAS Tech	 NASDAQ  US$18 1/2	 +1 1/2</p>
<p>Telecom	  N.Y.    US$40 3/8	 -0/01  *</p>
<p>Lion	    Sydney  A$3.42	     nil</p>
<p>Goodman	 Sydney  A$1.82		+2</p>
<p>Macraes	 Sydney  A$1.35	     -10</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of eight shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>- London prices are mid-rates.</p>
<p>- Asterisk * means stock is still trading  </p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
